	"data": "Module 4: Qdrant Vector Store — Implementation Detail\n\nPart of the Custom RAG Pipeline. See custom-rag-pipeline.md for the full system map.\n\nOverview\n\nThe vector store is the pipeline's long-term memory. It persists embedded chunks as searchable vectors with rich payloads, enabling both semantic similarity search and metadata-filtered retrieval. M4 receives EmbeddedChunk objects from M3 and upserts them into Qdrant, where they're queryable by M5 (Search Engine) and maintainable by M8…",
